<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Jan 31.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Jan 31.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in central regions of European Russia may be closed on January 31 due to strong winds and heavy snow, the Russian Weather Service said on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
